WEBVTT

00:03:59.503 --> 00:04:03.435
I got this Christmas card a few years ago
from patients in one of our programs.

00:04:03.459 --> 00:04:06.301
The younger brother is 86;
the older one is 95.

00:04:06.325 --> 00:04:08.971
They wanted to show me
how much more flexible they were.

00:04:08.995 --> 00:04:11.857
The following year they sent this,
which I thought was funny.

00:04:11.881 --> 00:04:12.882
(Laughter)

00:04:12.906 --> 00:04:14.076
You just never know.

00:04:14.100 --> 00:04:16.590
And what we found
was that 99 percent of the patients

00:04:16.614 --> 00:04:19.471
stopped or reversed the progression
of their heart disease.

00:04:19.495 --> 00:04:21.503
Now, I thought if we just
did good science,

00:04:21.527 --> 00:04:23.202
that would change medical practice.

00:04:23.226 --> 00:04:24.377
But that was naive.

00:04:24.401 --> 00:04:25.943
It's important, but not enough,

00:04:25.967 --> 00:04:28.024
because we doctors do
what we get paid to do

00:04:28.048 --> 00:04:30.006
and trained to do what we get paid to do,